        "поле": "wrong_photos",
        "що": "item outside outfit",
        "сирий": "{\"version\":\"1\",\"text\":\"I built this for an autumn evening at the theatre around a dark, tailored base. The blazer, skirt, shoes, bag and belt are all black, and the silk blouse and the pearl earrings add the light notes. Every piece I used is rated formal enough for an evening out: the blouse, blazer and dress shoes all sit in the smarter end of the scale, and the skirt covers a wide span. Silk and leather give the outfit a soft sheen without piling up shiny surfaces. The shoes have a low 3 cm heel, so they are dressy without being demanding. I have not judged weather or walking distance, because I don't know either.\",\"how_to_wear\":[\"Wear the silk blouse as your base, with the skirt below it.\",\"Put the blazer over the top, open or fastened as you like.\",\"Add the belt at your waist and the pearl earrings, and finish with the leather dress shoes.\"],\"wrong_photos\":[\"#3719·01: the catalogue photo shows a pink blouse, while the shop lists it as white.\"],\"named\":[{\"n\":\"#3719·01\",\"what\":\"silk blouse\"},{\"n\":\"#423·02\",\"what\":\"skirt\"},{\"n\":\"#774·05\",\"what\":\"blazer\"},{\"n\":\"#517·06\",\"what\":\"leather dress shoes\"},{\"n\":\"#8·07\",\"what\":\"leather bag\"},{\"n\":\"#46·08\",\"what\":\"belt\"},{\"n\":\"#14·12\",\"what\":\"pearl earrings\"}],\"about_items\":[{\"n\":\"#3719·01\",\"text\":\"A silk blouse, which gives the dark pieces a soft, light sheen. It is a dressy top, suited to an evening at the theatre.\"},{\"n\":\"#423·02\",\"text\":\"A polyester skirt, calf length by the shop's description and black. It is a quiet base that works with the blazer and the blouse.\"},{\"n\":\"#774·05\",\"text\":\"A black polyester blazer. It is the most formal layer of the outfit and gives the look its tailored line.\"},{\"n\":\"#517·06\",\"text\":\"Leather dress shoes with a 3 cm heel and a polymer sole. They match the formal level of the blazer and blouse. I make no claim about grip.\"},{\"n\":\"#8·07\",\"text\":\"A leather bag in black, which stays within the dark tones of the outfit.\"},{\"n\":\"#46·08\",\"text\":\"A black suede-look belt with a silver-toned oval buckle, which marks the waist and ties the dark pieces together.\"},{\"n\":\"#14·12\",\"text\":\"Large pearl drop earrings, pale and glossy. They bring a light accent up near your face, against the dark outfit.\"}],\"swap\":{\"item\":\"#3719·01\",\"why\":\"colour\",\"to\":\"#3661·01\"}}",
